// -------------------------------------------
// Image column convention.
// Store ImageAsset { url, width, height } as JSON in image text columns.
// (@/lib/image; added when connecting storage.) Multiple images use ImageAsset[] JSON.
// Resize on the client with resizeImage() before uploading, then save its width/height.
// -------------------------------------------


